        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Coughlin\n- Organizations: National Union for Social Justice, Boston Herald\n- Places: Calgary, Canada, United States\n- Roles: Founder, Roman Catholic priest\n- Topics: Canadian-American identity, controversy, rumor\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Coughlin was born in Calgary.\n- Charles Coughlin was a Canadian-American Roman Catholic priest.\n- Charles Coughlin founded the National Union for Social Justice.\n- Charles Coughlin was a controversial public figure.\n- Charles Coughlin started the Boston Herald rumor.",
